	(text "NOTES: (UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED)\n1. ALL COMPONENTS ARE 0603 (1608 METRIC).\n2. ALL RESISTOR VALUES ARE IN OHMS, 1%, 0.1W.\n3. ALL CAPACITOR VALUES ARE IN µF, 25V MIN.\n4. COMPONENTS MARKED \"DNP\" SHALL NOT BE POPULATED.\n5. ALL COMPONENTS MUST BE RoHS COMPLIANT.\n6. POPULATE ALL TEST POINTS (TP) WITH TEST LOOPS / PINS AS SPECIFIED IN BOM.\n"
