	(text "WARNING - HIGH-SIDE GATE MEASUREMENT (Q1):\nQ1_GATE voltage is referenced to the switching node (Q1_SOURCE [TP_S1], switching between 0V and +12V), NOT to GND.\nUse either a differential probe or the oscilloscope math function (CH1 - CH2) with two passive probes\n(one on Q1_GATE [TP_G1], one on Q1_SOURCE [TP_S1]).\nNEVER connect the ground clip of an earth-referenced oscilloscope probe to Q1_SOURCE [TP_S1]!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
